Are you trying to modify the BMP directly? That's bad; these tiles are
generated during compilation from text specifications. You should edit
these specifications in win/share/*.txt, such that one can easily
integrate your changes in future version or with patches adding new
monsters of objects. 

In those text files, the tiles are labeled with the name of the thing
they should depict.
